			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Finalize Vine notification system delegation to library crate\n\nConclude the systematic extraction of Mountain's gRPC notification handling into the dedicated `Vine` library by eliminating all remaining local implementations. On the client side, `PublishNotification`, `PublishNotificationFromMux`, and the entire `Shared` module (connection pool, broadcast channel, shutdown flag, metadata tracking) are reduced to empty stubs—Mountain's active code paths now use `::Vine::Client::*` directly. On the server side, the unregistration atoms (`UnregisterRemoteAuthorityResolver`, `UnregisterScmProvider`, `UnregisterTaskProvider`, `UnregisterUriHandler`) and the `RelayToSky` helper become thin delegators to their `::Vine::Server::Notification` counterparts.\n\nThis completes the migration of Cocoon→Mountain notification processing into the library layer, pruning Mountain's internal code surface and enforcing consistent IPC standards across the project.",
			"SHA": "01ebad1dfa8901cb226f06b4ddd8499e2ecbde57"
		},
