				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Use fully qualified Cache types in AssetMemoryMap shim\n\nRemove the local `Entry` module import from the `AssetMemoryMap::LoadOrInsert` shim, replacing it with the fully qualified type from the external `::Cache` crate.\n\nThis adjustment follows the recent pruning of redundant local cache modules in Mountain. By referencing `::Cache::AssetMemoryMap::Entry::Struct` directly in the function signature, the shim is decoupled from the internal module tree, ensuring it remains a pure pass-through to the central `Cache` crate logic.",
			"SHA": "abc9d4ce90be3f1ce524579fac36b45ff022eef3"
		}
